
== Biography

I received my Ph.D. in 2022 from the [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk Department of Computer Science and Engineering],  
[http://www.cuhk.edu.hk/english/index.html The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK)], 
under the supervision of [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~fyyoung/ Prof. Evangeline F.Y. Young].
Previously, I received my bachelor's degree in Software Engineering from [https://www.sdu.edu.cn/ Shandong University (SDU)]
and my master's degree in Computer Science and Technology from [https://www.buaa.edu.cn/ Beihang University (BUAA)].
My research interests include machine learning on design for manufacturability and physical design in VLSI CAD.
